            "en": "\"When a Full Charge attack hits a target within the effective range\" assumes the full-charge shot hits, and checks that this unit's landing point at the shot frame is within the effective range shortened by Spy Lens and the Burst's Minimum Effective Range up (the same check as the range bonus)"
