          "en": "At the near landing (outside the range), the ATK up is sometimes reapplied while Spy Lens is at max stacks (with Pierce), triggered by shots without the range bonus. The rule for which shot triggers it is unknown, so it is not modeled (plan/design-agent-bunny.md section 10, item 6)",
